      "name": "Pill Button (Filled)",
      "role": "Primary or secondary action",
      "description": "Border-radius 30px (full pill). Background: one of the filled chromatic colors (#2544a0, #ff7701, #4b0f4d, #d98199). Text: Klarheit Grotesk 14-16px bold, white. Padding: 12-16px vertical, 28-38px horizontal. No border, no shadow. The pill shape is the signature button form — used sparingly for browse/enter actions only."
