      "role": "Closing call-to-action bar",
      "description": "Full-bleed #160572 background, ~100-120px tall. Centered content: a tangerine pill button with white play-icon glyph, followed by 'Browse Illustrators.' in Klarheit Grotesk 22px bold, white. The contrast between the orange button and indigo bar is the strongest color pairing in the system."
